ABSTRACT

The Personal Finance Advisor Bot is an intelligent financial planning application designed to help users understand their income, monitor expenses, prepare monthly budgets, and develop better saving habits. The application combines a web-based user interface with a Python Flask backend, SQLite database storage, and optional Google Gemini AI integration.

Users can enter their monthly income, categorize expenses, specify financial goals, and obtain budget recommendations and spending insights. The application also supports saving suggestions, financial summaries, and expense history. When AI services are unavailable or not configured, a rule-based fallback can support the core financial planning workflow.

The primary objective of this project is to make basic financial planning more accessible through a simple, interactive, and technology-driven platform.

CHAPTER 1: INTRODUCTION
1.1 Introduction

Managing personal finances is an important part of everyday life. Individuals need to balance income, expenses, savings, and future financial goals. However, manual budgeting can be time-consuming and may not provide sufficient insight into spending patterns.

The Personal Finance Advisor Bot addresses this problem by providing a centralized application for entering financial information and generating useful budgeting insights. It uses conventional software technologies and optional artificial intelligence to assist users in making informed financial decisions.

1.2 Problem Statement

Many individuals struggle to track daily expenses, control unnecessary spending, set realistic savings targets, and prepare monthly budgets. Traditional methods such as notebooks and spreadsheets require manual calculations and consistent maintenance.

A digital application that organizes financial data and provides personalized guidance can simplify these activities.

1.3 Objectives
Develop a web-based personal finance management application.
Track monthly income and categorized expenses.
Generate personalized monthly budget suggestions.
Analyze spending patterns and identify areas for improvement.
Provide saving suggestions based on financial goals.
Store financial reports using a database.
Integrate AI-powered financial insights where configured.
Provide a rule-based fallback when AI is unavailable.
Offer optional Google Sheets integration for additional tracking.
1.4 Scope

The project focuses on personal budgeting and basic financial awareness. It supports income entry, expense categorization, budget generation, savings guidance, and financial reporting.

The application is intended for educational and personal planning purposes. It is not a banking platform, tax filing system, or professional investment advisory service.

