CHAPTER 7: DATABASE AND API DESIGN
7.1 Database

The project uses SQLite with SQLAlchemy. Database models and field definitions should be verified against the actual implementation in app.py before preparing a formal database schema.

The database layer is intended to preserve financial report information locally.

7.2 Health Endpoint

Endpoint: GET /api/health

Purpose: Returns application, database, and AI configuration status.

7.3 Financial Analysis Endpoint

Endpoint: POST /analyse

Purpose: Accepts financial information and returns structured analysis.

Example request:

json
{
  "income": 50000,
  "goal": "emergency fund",
  "expenses": {
    "rent": 12000,
    "food": 6000,
    "transport": 3000,
    "dining": 2000,
    "entertainment": 1500,
    "utilities": 3000,
    "savings": 5000
  },
  "expense_logs": []
}


The response can contain a success indicator, analysis source, budget information, spending analysis, saving suggestions, summary, report identifier, and cloud synchronization status.

7.4 Generation Endpoint

Endpoint: POST /generate

Purpose: Supports focused financial questions and compatible generation requests. The repository documentation indicates that it accepts either question or product_info.

