CHAPTER 12: CONCLUSION

The Personal Finance Advisor Bot demonstrates how web development, database technology, and artificial intelligence can be combined to support everyday financial planning.

The application provides a foundation for tracking income and expenses, generating budgets, analyzing spending, and producing savings suggestions. Its use of Flask, SQLite, SQLAlchemy, and optional Gemini AI integration makes it suitable as an educational software project.

The rule-based fallback improves usability when AI services are unavailable. Future development can strengthen the system through enhanced security, user authentication, predictive analytics, visualization, and more advanced reporting.

Overall, the project illustrates the potential of intelligent software to make personal budgeting more organized, accessible, and informative.

